<title>GERMANY: Henkel says to sell a German plant.</title>
<headline>Henkel says to sell a German plant.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals group Henkel AG said on Tuesday that it would sell a German plant linked to its Thera Cosmetic GmbH subsidiary in January.</p>
<p>Henkel said the plant, located in Krefeld, would be sold to Dalli-Werke Maeurer + Wirtz GmbH &amp; Co KG, which has agreed to secure the jobs of the 140 workers at the plant.</p>
<p>Henkel said its fragrance centre in Krefeld would not be affected by the sale.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
